Given the open-loop transfer function from the block diagram: \[G(s) = \frac{s + \alpha}{s^3 + (1 + \alpha)s^2 + (\alpha - 1)s + (1 - \alpha)}\] For unity negative feedback, the characteristic equation is \(1 + G(s) = 0\): \[s^3 + (1 + \alpha)s^2 + (\alpha - 1)s + (1 - \alpha) + (s + \alpha) = 0\] \[s^3 + (1 + \alpha)s^2 + \alpha s + 1 = 0\] Constructing the Routh array: \[\begin{array}{c|cc}
s^3 &amp; 1 &amp; \alpha \\
